(2688840, 373626, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice kitty shot.  Looks like the cat is waiting for you to leave so it can take a nap. ;^)</td>', 'Nice kitty shot.  Looks like the cat is waiting for you to leave so it can take a nap. ;^)', '2006-08-02 15:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688842, 373327, 62278, '<td valign="top">bit guiness this one!</td>', 'bit guiness this one!', '2006-08-02 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688849, 373494, 30049, '<td valign="top">Action is ok, not really fond of the blue color cast.</td>', 'Action is ok, not really fond of the blue color cast.', '2006-08-02 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688854, 373654, 30049, '<td valign="top">Slo-mo action.  ;^)  Nice detail.  Good luck.</td>', 'Slo-mo action.  ;^)  Nice detail.  Good luck.', '2006-08-02 15:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688857, 372654, 30049, '<td valign="top">Has anyone mentioned that this shot is a little grainy?  Looks like a fun event to have attended.</td>', 'Has anyone mentioned that this shot is a little grainy?  Looks like a fun event to have attended.', '2006-08-02 15:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688858, 372059, 62278, '<td valign="top">captivating! love it.</td>', 'captivating! love it.', '2006-08-02 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688863, 373431, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  The image seems underexposed quite a bit.  I like your choice of angle and the way you''ve composed it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice concept.  The image seems underexposed quite a bit.  I like your choice of angle and the way you''ve composed it.  Good luck.', '2006-08-02 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688886, 373713, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is kind of fun.  Will probably get clobbered for the challenge (grain, blur, etc...), but I like it.  It has an old-time nostalgic feel to it - like an image you''d see from the late 60''s or something.  Appears you used a spot filter for the blur?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is kind of fun.  Will probably get clobbered for the challenge (grain, blur, etc...), but I like it.  It has an old-time nostalgic feel to it - like an image you''d see from the late 60''s or something.  Appears you used a spot filter for the blur?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-02 15:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688887, 372666, 62278, '<td valign="top">truly beautiful!</td>', 'truly beautiful!', '2006-08-02 15:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688892, 370365, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not really getting a feel for ''Action Shot'' here.  Seems more like ''Motion Blur'' or ''Panning''.  JMO of course.  The arrangement of your subject in the frame is good.</td>', 'Not really getting a feel for ''Action Shot'' here.  Seems more like ''Motion Blur'' or ''Panning''.  JMO of course.  The arrangement of your subject in the frame is good.', '2006-08-02 15:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688896, 372867, 57464, '<td valign="top">Some part of this picture should be in focus</td>', 'Some part of this picture should be in focus', '2006-08-02 15:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688901, 370415, 57464, '<td valign="top">It looks more like standing on trees</td>', 'It looks more like standing on trees', '2006-08-02 15:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688910, 372724, 57464, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is a backshot...a view from the front would have rated higher</td>', 'Too bad this is a backshot...a view from the front would have rated higher', '2006-08-02 15:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688914, 370921, 59215, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! I would suggest adjusting the levels a bit... brighten up the mid-tones and the whole image just a bit.</td>', 'Nice photo! I would suggest adjusting the levels a bit... brighten up the mid-tones and the whole image just a bit.', '2006-08-02 15:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688917, 372094, 57464, '<td valign="top">a tighter zoom would have rated this higher, but good job</td>', 'a tighter zoom would have rated this higher, but good job', '2006-08-02 15:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688920, 372060, 57464, '<td valign="top">This would have been great if something would have been in focus</td>', 'This would have been great if something would have been in focus', '2006-08-02 15:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688925, 370075, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is this a one-handed shot?  Neat idea and concept but it''s too blurry and overexposed.  A tripod and timer release with some light control would make this work better.  I took a similar image for the 2-Second Challenge titled ''Lazy Left''.  Take a peek when you have time if you care to.  [thumb]307522[/thumb]<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Is this a one-handed shot?  Neat idea and concept but it''s too blurry and overexposed.  A tripod and timer release with some light control would make this work better.  I took a similar image for the 2-Second Challenge titled ''Lazy Left''.  Take a peek when you have time if you care to.  [thumb]307522[/thumb] Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-02 15:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688927, 372957, 59215, '<td valign="top">What a fun picture!<br/> <br/>I would adjust the levels on the green channel just a bit, just to reduce some of the greenish tint.</td>', 'What a fun picture! I would adjust the levels on the green channel just a bit, just to reduce some of the greenish tint.', '2006-08-02 15:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688935, 373741, 57464, '<td valign="top">Exclude the car interior and your score would have been off the charts!</td>', 'Exclude the car interior and your score would have been off the charts!', '2006-08-02 15:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688938, 373761, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a decent Action Shot for content.  The image itself seems flat and could use some contrast to liven it up some.  A tad underexposed, and a little noisy also.</td>', 'This is a decent Action Shot for content.  The image itself seems flat and could use some contrast to liven it up some.  A tad underexposed, and a little noisy also.', '2006-08-02 15:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688941, 373714, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like he was moving a bit too fast for your panning.  Look directly behind the rider, it''s more in focus (log/tree in background) there.  Hope you didn''t get wet shooting this!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like he was moving a bit too fast for your panning.  Look directly behind the rider, it''s more in focus (log/tree in background) there.  Hope you didn''t get wet shooting this!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-02 15:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688958, 373688, 57464, '<td valign="top">Pretty blurry</td>', 'Pretty blurry', '2006-08-02 15:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688984, 372179, 24694, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit oversharpened?</td>', 'Perhaps a bit oversharpened?', '2006-08-02 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688997, 373627, 24694, '<td valign="top">Cute shot... looks like the white balance might be off?</td>', 'Cute shot... looks like the white balance might be off?', '2006-08-02 15:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689010, 373431, 27339, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed. You could probably adjust the levels and contrast and make this a working image</td>', 'A little underexposed. You could probably adjust the levels and contrast and make this a working image', '2006-08-02 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689029, 373497, 24694, '<td valign="top">Really nice, and original. If only that one silly bubble weren''t obstructing a large portion of his face. Good job nonetheless!</td>', 'Really nice, and original. If only that one silly bubble weren''t obstructing a large portion of his face. Good job nonetheless!', '2006-08-02 15:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689043, 372268, 24694, '<td valign="top">Is this a real wedding or staged?? Just curious.</td>', 'Is this a real wedding or staged?? Just curious.', '2006-08-02 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689050, 373566, 62278, '<td valign="top">stunning shot!</td>', 'stunning shot!', '2006-08-02 15:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689051, 372701, 62278, '<td valign="top">superb! cropped very tight though?</td>', 'superb! cropped very tight though?', '2006-08-02 15:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689071, 372654, 27339, '<td valign="top">Would be better with less grain and a bit better focus. Good capture of the faces though</td>', 'Would be better with less grain and a bit better focus. Good capture of the faces though', '2006-08-02 16:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689085, 373150, 27339, '<td valign="top">May be slightly too contrasty to see some detail in the shadows</td>', 'May be slightly too contrasty to see some detail in the shadows', '2006-08-02 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689087, 373527, 30049, '<td valign="top">Talk about timing!  That right foot is just touching down.  Burst mode, or lucky?  Wait, I know...superb shutter release control!  ;^)</td>', 'Talk about timing!  That right foot is just touching down.  Burst mode, or lucky?  Wait, I know...superb shutter release control!  ;^)', '2006-08-02 16:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689090, 371536, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve panned with the club head.  Wish the ball wasn''t quite so hot.  The grains of dirt coming up add to the Action in this shot.</td>', 'I like how you''ve panned with the club head.  Wish the ball wasn''t quite so hot.  The grains of dirt coming up add to the Action in this shot.', '2006-08-02 16:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689094, 373463, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  Too bad you couldn''t have picked a more interesting section of road for your shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is fun.  Too bad you couldn''t have picked a more interesting section of road for your shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-02 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689106, 372268, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  Impact might have been greater with a lower angle.  The bouquet is lost in the background trees.  With her looking at the camera it feels a bit posed and snapshotish.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fun shot.  Impact might have been greater with a lower angle.  The bouquet is lost in the background trees.  With her looking at the camera it feels a bit posed and snapshotish.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-02 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689110, 370180, 30049, '<td valign="top">Unique shot.  This has a strong sense of ''Action'' and movement.</td>', 'Unique shot.  This has a strong sense of ''Action'' and movement.', '2006-08-02 16:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689117, 373303, 30049, '<td valign="top">What in the world?  Either you had a long lens, you''re a bit crazy to be this close, there is a fence the viewer can''t see, or this coyote has been to a taxidermist?  This would really jump out if you could see the eyes.</td>', 'What in the world?  Either you had a long lens, you''re a bit crazy to be this close, there is a fence the viewer can''t see, or this coyote has been to a taxidermist?  This would really jump out if you could see the eyes.', '2006-08-02 16:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689141, 373531, 21714, '<td valign="top">O man! Fine composition and precise timing. Wonderful shot. Don''t you wish you could submit a much larger version? :)<br/>Wonder if this is from imagineer (came across some fine shots today)</td>', 'O man! Fine composition and precise timing. Wonderful shot. Don''t you wish you could submit a much larger version? :)Wonder if this is from imagineer (came across some fine shots today)', '2006-08-02 16:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689153, 373571, 21714, '<td valign="top">Made me smile and think of childhood. Nice work.</td>', 'Made me smile and think of childhood. Nice work.', '2006-08-02 16:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689171, 373396, 37730, '<td valign="top">8 :)  nicely done.</td>', '8 :)  nicely done.', '2006-08-02 16:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689191, 373542, 21714, '<td valign="top">I have been looking at this image for a very long time now. It gets better and better. A beautiful moment that we''d never be able to enjoy without this image.<br/>With all the raw energy in it, there''s yet such a beautiful and delicate flow to the shapes and shades.<br/>You have done an excellent job to capture it and present it for all to enjoy. <br/>Brilliant photography.</td>', 'I have been looking at this image for a very long time now. It gets better and better. A beautiful moment that we''d never be able to enjoy without this image.With all the raw energy in it, there''s yet such a beautiful and delicate flow to the shapes and shades.You have done an excellent job to capture it and present it for all to enjoy. Brilliant photography.', '2006-08-02 16:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689195, 373170, 58728, '<td valign="top">Cute photo.  I wish is was bigger though.</td>', 'Cute photo.  I wish is was bigger though.', '2006-08-02 16:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
