(2689316, 373526, 62554, '<td valign="top">Classic B&amp;W tones, tack sharp, excellent DoF and a tight crop.  Pro shot.</td>', 'Classic B&W tones, tack sharp, excellent DoF and a tight crop.  Pro shot.', '2006-08-02 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
