(2689473, 373675, 60223, '<td valign="top">It appears this is just after the action has taken place.  Also, what is that along the top edge that looks like glare?</td>', 'It appears this is just after the action has taken place.  Also, what is that along the top edge that looks like glare?', '2006-08-02 18:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689476, 373014, 48360, '<td valign="top">Image is too small.</td>', 'Image is too small.', '2006-08-02 18:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689486, 372161, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. Stunning clarity, beautiful colours, perfect composition, there is nothing wrong with it, it is PERFECT. The Atlantic Puffin is the official bird of Newfoundland and I would be ecstatic if I could get a photo of one half as good as this. 10, and I wish I could give you more.</td>', 'I love this picture. Stunning clarity, beautiful colours, perfect composition, there is nothing wrong with it, it is PERFECT. The Atlantic Puffin is the official bird of Newfoundland and I would be ecstatic if I could get a photo of one half as good as this. 10, and I wish I could give you more.', '2006-08-02 18:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689491, 373708, 53316, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t figure this out from the thumbnail but after looking at the full sized image, I am so impressed.  That is a very large understatement.  This is not an aesthetically appealing image to me, and normally technical aptitude will only push me to vote a certain amount higher, but here I am voting high because the technical side of this image is just so amazing to me.  I have never seen anything like this before and I am so pleased that I got to do so while voting on this challenge.</td>', 'I couldn''t figure this out from the thumbnail but after looking at the full sized image, I am so impressed.  That is a very large understatement.  This is not an aesthetically appealing image to me, and normally technical aptitude will only push me to vote a certain amount higher, but here I am voting high because the technical side of this image is just so amazing to me.  I have never seen anything like this before and I am so pleased that I got to do so while voting on this challenge.', '2006-08-02 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689495, 373738, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the lines made by the grass and the legs.</td>', 'I love the lines made by the grass and the legs.', '2006-08-02 18:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
