(2691508, 373537, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like to do Aviation Photography and at the sites I post pictures, the fence would get my photo''s rejected for ''foreground clutter''. However, this isn''t one of those sites. The fence does take away from the photo though but I understand it has to be there for your title to fit the picture. The action is stopped well but if it were me and I couldn''t find an angle without the fence, I would have concentrated the crop to the rider above the fence line. Nice ''Roost'' by the way!</td>', 'I like to do Aviation Photography and at the sites I post pictures, the fence would get my photo''s rejected for ''foreground clutter''. However, this isn''t one of those sites. The fence does take away from the photo though but I understand it has to be there for your title to fit the picture. The action is stopped well but if it were me and I couldn''t find an angle without the fence, I would have concentrated the crop to the rider above the fence line. Nice ''Roost'' by the way!', '2006-08-03 10:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2691513, 373627, 62187, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2006-08-03 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
