(2692607, 372790, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection you''ve captured here!  Why the small sizing on the image?  Did you look at this with the top cropped off a bit to lose the boat structure in the upper left corner?  Good luck, hope this does ok for you.</td>', 'Very nice reflection you''ve captured here!  Why the small sizing on the image?  Did you look at this with the top cropped off a bit to lose the boat structure in the upper left corner?  Good luck, hope this does ok for you.', '2006-08-03 15:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692615, 373717, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool action, distracting background.</td>', 'Cool action, distracting background.', '2006-08-03 15:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692626, 370316, 30049, '<td valign="top">Didn''t you find it amusing that there is an exciting play at the plate going on and fellow teammate #22 doesn''t appear to have any interest in what happens?  ;^)  Good job of capturing the timing of the slide correctly.  How deep were you on aperture?  I wonder if there was enough distance between the play and the stands to have blurred them out some with a shallower choice?</td>', 'Didn''t you find it amusing that there is an exciting play at the plate going on and fellow teammate #22 doesn''t appear to have any interest in what happens?  ;^)  Good job of capturing the timing of the slide correctly.  How deep were you on aperture?  I wonder if there was enough distance between the play and the stands to have blurred them out some with a shallower choice?', '2006-08-03 15:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692631, 373756, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, and that backgroud color!  Wow!  Almost could have been just a little faster on shutter speed - the surfer is slightly blurred (not very much, just a little).  Very nice capture.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a cool shot, and that backgroud color!  Wow!  Almost could have been just a little faster on shutter speed - the surfer is slightly blurred (not very much, just a little).  Very nice capture.  Good luck.', '2006-08-03 15:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692637, 373675, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  A keeper for the photo album for sure.  ;^)  I think you''ve captured a nice moment here and the water splash and ripples adds to it.  One thing that could help this (IMO of course) is to seriously crop the bottom and top out some.</td>', 'Yep.  A keeper for the photo album for sure.  ;^)  I think you''ve captured a nice moment here and the water splash and ripples adds to it.  One thing that could help this (IMO of course) is to seriously crop the bottom and top out some.', '2006-08-03 15:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
