(2693357, 373463, 70, '<td valign="top">The only part of this image that really says action is the speedometer and I''m not sure that alone is enough to convey a sense of action for the photo. This photo unfortunately lacks a point of interest. The windshield is dirty and buggy and the scenery is not especially appealing or interesting. Sorry.</td>', 'The only part of this image that really says action is the speedometer and I''m not sure that alone is enough to convey a sense of action for the photo. This photo unfortunately lacks a point of interest. The windshield is dirty and buggy and the scenery is not especially appealing or interesting. Sorry.', '2006-08-03 19:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693360, 372997, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is not good. Yes it is action but no it is not a good photograph more like an over worked snapshot. Whatever you did to this image was too much. There is too much noise maybe caused by using shadow/highlight and it leaves a glow around the guy in the air.<br/>You get an (A) for effort but remember less is more. As a good photographer once told me when you think you have adjusted it enough back up about half.</td>', 'This is not good. Yes it is action but no it is not a good photograph more like an over worked snapshot. Whatever you did to this image was too much. There is too much noise maybe caused by using shadow/highlight and it leaves a glow around the guy in the air.You get an (A) for effort but remember less is more. As a good photographer once told me when you think you have adjusted it enough back up about half.', '2006-08-03 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
