(2694615, 373703, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  The highlights in the spray look overexposed to me.  It looks like it would be hard to get good detail in the rock and not overexpose the spray.</td>', 'I like this idea.  The highlights in the spray look overexposed to me.  It looks like it would be hard to get good detail in the rock and not overexpose the spray.', '2006-08-04 07:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694621, 372268, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like seeing the ladies over the bride''s shoulder.  One thing I would change if I could would be to make the bouquet more visible against the trees.  Although, trying to find it did capture my attention.</td>', 'I like seeing the ladies over the bride''s shoulder.  One thing I would change if I could would be to make the bouquet more visible against the trees.  Although, trying to find it did capture my attention.', '2006-08-04 07:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694624, 373545, 29513, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is intense.  You could have gone either way on the depth of field by focusing on the faces of the observers but I think you made the right choice.  It is hard to look at that face for long.</td>', 'Wow, this is intense.  You could have gone either way on the depth of field by focusing on the faces of the observers but I think you made the right choice.  It is hard to look at that face for long.', '2006-08-04 08:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
