(2695404, 373113, 24846, '<td valign="top">I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. Nice capture of this New Jersey band. Great choice using b/w. I find the sky a bit distracting but I don''t see how you could have cropped any more. Good shot. Good luck</td>', 'I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. Nice capture of this New Jersey band. Great choice using b/w. I find the sky a bit distracting but I don''t see how you could have cropped any more. Good shot. Good luck', '2006-08-04 14:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695410, 372790, 24846, '<td valign="top">I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. This is different and I like the reflection and all, just too bad you didn''t use all of dpc''s real estate. Good luck</td>', 'I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. This is different and I like the reflection and all, just too bad you didn''t use all of dpc''s real estate. Good luck', '2006-08-04 14:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695417, 373504, 24846, '<td valign="top">I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. While I''ve seen several bike shots this is very neat silhouette you capture. Great composition and clouds really add to this. Good luck -8-</td>', 'I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. While I''ve seen several bike shots this is very neat silhouette you capture. Great composition and clouds really add to this. Good luck -8-', '2006-08-04 14:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695419, 373600, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great composition and captured tail grab. If I was picking nits I would probably prefer to see the rider in an open stance, but this is neat.</td>', 'Great composition and captured tail grab. If I was picking nits I would probably prefer to see the rider in an open stance, but this is neat.', '2006-08-04 14:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695421, 372160, 24846, '<td valign="top">I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. This carnival ride show great expression captured here. Like the composition and color too. Good luck</td>', 'I plan on only voting for the "not your typical" shots this challenge. This carnival ride show great expression captured here. Like the composition and color too. Good luck', '2006-08-04 14:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695423, 370706, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well caught. For a horse though I prefer a panning shot at slower shutter speed to catch the vigour of the movement. Frozen, they can sometimes look a little gangly unless at full tilt with all legs off the ground and mud kicked up. Crop is bit tight, but I find that the 640 pixel contsraint can sometimes make one go for an unnatural crop just to get detail.</td>', 'Well caught. For a horse though I prefer a panning shot at slower shutter speed to catch the vigour of the movement. Frozen, they can sometimes look a little gangly unless at full tilt with all legs off the ground and mud kicked up. Crop is bit tight, but I find that the 640 pixel contsraint can sometimes make one go for an unnatural crop just to get detail.', '2006-08-04 14:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695429, 370576, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well caught indeed with some interesting blur. I know how tough this is to get so hats off to the take off.</td>', 'Well caught indeed with some interesting blur. I know how tough this is to get so hats off to the take off.', '2006-08-04 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695434, 373742, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good gritty panning shot. Tough to get, but you nailed it. Particularly good to get board and rider in focus. Crop''s a a tad tight, but hey.</td>', 'Good gritty panning shot. Tough to get, but you nailed it. Particularly good to get board and rider in focus. Crop''s a a tad tight, but hey.', '2006-08-04 14:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695450, 373735, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute tie-in with the title.  Took me a sec to see the dog.  This is interesting.  Compositionally you have the rows of wood centered, which works, and the subject drastically off-centered yet balanced with the girl on the far right.  Great eye to see this image come together.  The B/W tone also works well to help isolate the lighter colors (whites) in the girls and dog.  Non-comforming, yet impressing!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute tie-in with the title.  Took me a sec to see the dog.  This is interesting.  Compositionally you have the rows of wood centered, which works, and the subject drastically off-centered yet balanced with the girl on the far right.  Great eye to see this image come together.  The B/W tone also works well to help isolate the lighter colors (whites) in the girls and dog.  Non-comforming, yet impressing!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-04 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695452, 373689, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is ok.  The image comes together well with your subject framing.  Enough going on to hold the viewers interest.  Only bummer I see is the dreary sky.  Kind of makes the image feel a little flat (in general).  The forefront subject is fine.  I hope that''s clearer than mud.  ;^)</td>', 'This is ok.  The image comes together well with your subject framing.  Enough going on to hold the viewers interest.  Only bummer I see is the dreary sky.  Kind of makes the image feel a little flat (in general).  The forefront subject is fine.  I hope that''s clearer than mud.  ;^)', '2006-08-04 14:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695459, 370921, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good use of B/W to isolate the boy in this image.  I can almost hear the flapping of the wings!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good use of B/W to isolate the boy in this image.  I can almost hear the flapping of the wings!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-04 14:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695460, 370829, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nope.  He''s not going anywhere. ;^)  Some optimistic people having all those trailers to bring their vehicles back...wonder how they''ll get them loaded?!  I love the dirt flying in the air and the blue smoke adds to the drama.  The background is a bummer (distracting).  Hope this does ok for you.</td>', 'Nope.  He''s not going anywhere. ;^)  Some optimistic people having all those trailers to bring their vehicles back...wonder how they''ll get them loaded?!  I love the dirt flying in the air and the blue smoke adds to the drama.  The background is a bummer (distracting).  Hope this does ok for you.', '2006-08-04 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695464, 372358, 30049, '<td valign="top">I want to know what''s at the bottom of the rope/cable?!  Such a tease this image is.  ;^)  It''s a nice shot of a helicopter.  Don''t take this the wrong way, but it feels a bit static - like a product shot or something.  No major drama or wow factor.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I want to know what''s at the bottom of the rope/cable?!  Such a tease this image is.  ;^)  It''s a nice shot of a helicopter.  Don''t take this the wrong way, but it feels a bit static - like a product shot or something.  No major drama or wow factor.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-04 14:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695470, 371528, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I think you may have been trying to include too much to give the viewer a sense of context of this image.  A tighter framing of the diver, to include the two friends and the waterfall would have been enough.  Trim the top and left by about 20%?  Just a thought of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I think you may have been trying to include too much to give the viewer a sense of context of this image.  A tighter framing of the diver, to include the two friends and the waterfall would have been enough.  Trim the top and left by about 20%?  Just a thought of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-04 14:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695509, 373268, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action capture! Think it could be cropped a bit tighter.</td>', 'Wonderful action capture! Think it could be cropped a bit tighter.', '2006-08-04 15:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695513, 373284, 9668, '<td valign="top">Is one of the bikers leaving the rest of them? Or all the bikers leaving the world behind? Becuase you image doens''t seem to convey that to me.<br/>Wonderful action capture though, great panning freeze.</td>', 'Is one of the bikers leaving the rest of them? Or all the bikers leaving the world behind? Becuase you image doens''t seem to convey that to me.Wonderful action capture though, great panning freeze.', '2006-08-04 15:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695521, 373531, 9668, '<td valign="top">Similar to what I entered into this competition. This has the wow factor and will make the top 10. Awesome image!</td>', 'Similar to what I entered into this competition. This has the wow factor and will make the top 10. Awesome image!', '2006-08-04 15:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695524, 372241, 30049, '<td valign="top">Might have to try this again for the ''Stopped Motion'' challenge.  ;^)</td>', 'Might have to try this again for the ''Stopped Motion'' challenge.  ;^)', '2006-08-04 15:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695532, 370563, 9668, '<td valign="top">The look is wild, but I wouldn''t say something is wild when there is a fence behind it.</td>', 'The look is wild, but I wouldn''t say something is wild when there is a fence behind it.', '2006-08-04 15:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695533, 372865, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a nice field to play on, such lush grass!  A couple of things I like about this image vs other soccer/rugby images in this challenge is that you''ve captured a nice focused action shot, and you don''t have a distracting cluttered background (road sign and lamp post are very minor in comparison).  The look of concentration of the back guy is cool also.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  What a nice field to play on, such lush grass!  A couple of things I like about this image vs other soccer/rugby images in this challenge is that you''ve captured a nice focused action shot, and you don''t have a distracting cluttered background (road sign and lamp post are very minor in comparison).  The look of concentration of the back guy is cool also.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-04 15:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695536, 371585, 9668, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have edited the colors to make it this red, but cool silhouettes.</td>', 'Looks like you have edited the colors to make it this red, but cool silhouettes.', '2006-08-04 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695537, 373526, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great choice to go B/W here.  You''ve eliminated alot of distractions to the viewer this way and allow the main subjects to get the focus.  Nice DOF and good crisp focus on the main players.  Well done.</td>', 'Great choice to go B/W here.  You''ve eliminated alot of distractions to the viewer this way and allow the main subjects to get the focus.  Nice DOF and good crisp focus on the main players.  Well done.', '2006-08-04 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695539, 372719, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely interpretation! Nature is incredible isn''t it!</td>', 'Lovely interpretation! Nature is incredible isn''t it!', '2006-08-04 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695541, 373097, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is very hard shooting scenario, but you''ve done a great job with it. The color of the water and skin is right on, and the lighting is beautiful, and it freezes the motion. Well done!</td>', 'This is very hard shooting scenario, but you''ve done a great job with it. The color of the water and skin is right on, and the lighting is beautiful, and it freezes the motion. Well done!', '2006-08-04 15:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695543, 373148, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s ok.  The background is a little busy...wish it was blurred just a tad more.  Would also like to see more of the birds head.  Maybe it''s the subject (many seagulls).  Sorry.  The seagull is well focused and that''s a positive.  ;^)</td>', 'It''s ok.  The background is a little busy...wish it was blurred just a tad more.  Would also like to see more of the birds head.  Maybe it''s the subject (many seagulls).  Sorry.  The seagull is well focused and that''s a positive.  ;^)', '2006-08-04 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695544, 373693, 9668, '<td valign="top">Could you not catch her/him midair? Stiill cool with the splash. Looks a bit tilted and a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Could you not catch her/him midair? Stiill cool with the splash. Looks a bit tilted and a bit oversharpened.', '2006-08-04 15:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695547, 372161, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, crisply focused, good tonal range, interesting to look at.  Some bokeh working in the background.  Should do well with this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute, crisply focused, good tonal range, interesting to look at.  Some bokeh working in the background.  Should do well with this one.  Good luck.', '2006-08-04 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695559, 371547, 9668, '<td valign="top">Could you not think of anything better for the title? Wonderful shot though!</td>', 'Could you not think of anything better for the title? Wonderful shot though!', '2006-08-04 15:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695579, 373504, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the silhoette and color in this image.  Very nicely done.  Congrats!</td>', 'I really like the silhoette and color in this image.  Very nicely done.  Congrats!', '2006-08-04 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695584, 373003, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  Fun to look at action here.  Great clarity and exposure.  Well done.</td>', 'What a fun shot!  Fun to look at action here.  Great clarity and exposure.  Well done.', '2006-08-04 15:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695624, 372988, 24951, '<td valign="top">This would have been outstanding except the post processing is off or would seem too much going on in the midrange or neutrals. Highlights need toning down.Some contrast problems. But it looks loke a real workable pic.</td>', 'This would have been outstanding except the post processing is off or would seem too much going on in the midrange or neutrals. Highlights need toning down.Some contrast problems. But it looks loke a real workable pic.', '2006-08-04 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695628, 373327, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed.  Great clarity and detail.  Selecting B/W works very well here as it helps to isolate your subjects even more and removes distracting bg items.  Well done!</td>', 'Wonderfully composed.  Great clarity and detail.  Selecting B/W works very well here as it helps to isolate your subjects even more and removes distracting bg items.  Well done!', '2006-08-04 16:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695633, 370910, 30049, '<td valign="top">Our horses do this when they''ve been spooked (sometimes just the wind can do it).  Looks like their grazing was interrupted by the grass still in their mouths.  ;^)  Time for grain at the barn?  Anyway, I''ve enjoyed viewing your challenge entry.  Certainly shows action, has a pleasing composition as is well focused.  Good luck.</td>', 'Our horses do this when they''ve been spooked (sometimes just the wind can do it).  Looks like their grazing was interrupted by the grass still in their mouths.  ;^)  Time for grain at the barn?  Anyway, I''ve enjoyed viewing your challenge entry.  Certainly shows action, has a pleasing composition as is well focused.  Good luck.', '2006-08-04 16:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695638, 373062, 30049, '<td valign="top">Three certainly are a number of horse images in this challenge.  Several of which are scoring quite highly from me - this one included.  You''ve done a nice job of catching an ''Action Shot'' here without a doubt.  The image is crisp and well focused and tells a story.  Very well done.</td>', 'Three certainly are a number of horse images in this challenge.  Several of which are scoring quite highly from me - this one included.  You''ve done a nice job of catching an ''Action Shot'' here without a doubt.  The image is crisp and well focused and tells a story.  Very well done.', '2006-08-04 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695640, 373429, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the action in this shot.  Fun to look at.  Couple of things that would have moved this to the top of the challenge (IMO obviously) is a higher shutter speed if possible to really stop action on the horse (it''s a little soft/blurry), and a touch more contrast (could be the dust making it appear a little flat).  Overall, well done - 8.</td>', 'I love the action in this shot.  Fun to look at.  Couple of things that would have moved this to the top of the challenge (IMO obviously) is a higher shutter speed if possible to really stop action on the horse (it''s a little soft/blurry), and a touch more contrast (could be the dust making it appear a little flat).  Overall, well done - 8.', '2006-08-04 16:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695681, 371542, 13487, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... my only complaint is that you cropped off part of his right hand.</td>', 'Nice shot... my only complaint is that you cropped off part of his right hand.', '2006-08-04 16:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695701, 373303, 60850, '<td valign="top">HOLY &amp;#@*!!!  I''ve never seen a coyote do that... most coyotes I''ve seen are running the other way.<br/> <br/>About the photo itself... I would have liked it a bit sharper and maybe tweak the levels/curves/color.  But I think you captured a great moment! 8</td>', 'HOLY &#@*!!!  I''ve never seen a coyote do that... most coyotes I''ve seen are running the other way. About the photo itself... I would have liked it a bit sharper and maybe tweak the levels/curves/color.  But I think you captured a great moment! 8', '2006-08-04 16:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2695863, 373504, 60850, '<td valign="top">Wow... the sky is awesome in this picture!  9</td>', 'Wow... the sky is awesome in this picture!  9', '2006-08-04 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
