(2696152, 373504, 58785, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I love the way colors in the sky, and the rider is a shadow only. Very good job. 10 (because there are no higher numbers)</td>', 'Excellent shot. I love the way colors in the sky, and the rider is a shadow only. Very good job. 10 (because there are no higher numbers)', '2006-08-04 20:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696158, 373003, 58785, '<td valign="top">This is one of the photos in this challenge dropped my jaw. This photo should win something else than a virtual ribbon. 10 + for this, and keep up the good work, whoever you are ;)</td>', 'This is one of the photos in this challenge dropped my jaw. This photo should win something else than a virtual ribbon. 10 + for this, and keep up the good work, whoever you are ;)', '2006-08-04 20:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696161, 373531, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Black and white colors gave this photo extra look. Awesome catch, and I still pondering how did you take this one... I mean the person is so high, even trampoline wouldn''t be able to do that... Fish eye lens, maybe. Anyway, keep up the good work :)</td>', 'Very nice shot. Black and white colors gave this photo extra look. Awesome catch, and I still pondering how did you take this one... I mean the person is so high, even trampoline wouldn''t be able to do that... Fish eye lens, maybe. Anyway, keep up the good work :)', '2006-08-04 20:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696162, 373600, 58785, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition, contrast, lights... everything perfect for my eyes. 10 +</td>', 'Colors, composition, contrast, lights... everything perfect for my eyes. 10 +', '2006-08-04 20:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696166, 373254, 58785, '<td valign="top">The focusing on this photo, and everything else... just stunning. If I see one person gives less than 7 to this photo, I go personally smack him or her. 10 +</td>', 'The focusing on this photo, and everything else... just stunning. If I see one person gives less than 7 to this photo, I go personally smack him or her. 10 +', '2006-08-04 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
