(2697005, 372719, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of mushrooms, but trying to shoe-horn it into an Action challenge just doesn''t cut it for me.  I''m one that puts as much scoring value on the theme as I do for the quality of shot.</td>', 'Nice shot of mushrooms, but trying to shoe-horn it into an Action challenge just doesn''t cut it for me.  I''m one that puts as much scoring value on the theme as I do for the quality of shot.', '2006-08-05 09:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
