(2697009, 373746, 34836, '<td valign="top">Legal shot maybe, but the theme was Action.  I don''t see the correlation between anything in your photo and the theme.</td>', 'Legal shot maybe, but the theme was Action.  I don''t see the correlation between anything in your photo and the theme.', '2006-08-05 09:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697012, 373293, 34836, '<td valign="top">1. Picture is too small.  2. The rider doesn''t really look like they''re in a race.  Looks more like just coasting down a hill.  3. Good focus, but I would have moved the subject a little to the left of center to give the effect of riding into the picture.</td>', '1. Picture is too small.  2. The rider doesn''t really look like they''re in a race.  Looks more like just coasting down a hill.  3. Good focus, but I would have moved the subject a little to the left of center to give the effect of riding into the picture.', '2006-08-05 09:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697015, 373254, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the arm in front of the face really hinders this shot.  With a person in Action, the look on their face (IMO) is key to making the viewer feel the picture.</td>', 'Good composition, but the arm in front of the face really hinders this shot.  With a person in Action, the look on their face (IMO) is key to making the viewer feel the picture.', '2006-08-05 09:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697019, 370044, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good exposure for a night shot.  Although the cars are in action, there isn''t too much to catch a viewer''s attention.  I keep getting drawn to the church steeple, which really isn''t that impressive (it''s also a little crooked).  The big static car on the right sort of detracts from the action as well.</td>', 'Good exposure for a night shot.  Although the cars are in action, there isn''t too much to catch a viewer''s attention.  I keep getting drawn to the church steeple, which really isn''t that impressive (it''s also a little crooked).  The big static car on the right sort of detracts from the action as well.', '2006-08-05 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697021, 373255, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a bird landing.  Could use a little more action in my opinion.  The whites on the birds are washed out and the darks have lost their detail.  I''d try shooting this at a different time in the day when you can control the exposure more.</td>', 'Nice photo of a bird landing.  Could use a little more action in my opinion.  The whites on the birds are washed out and the darks have lost their detail.  I''d try shooting this at a different time in the day when you can control the exposure more.', '2006-08-05 09:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697025, 373627, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good picture of kids having fun.  The background is a little cluttered.  A tighter crop would have helped this one, possibly a more rectangular crop of just the kids.</td>', 'Good picture of kids having fun.  The background is a little cluttered.  A tighter crop would have helped this one, possibly a more rectangular crop of just the kids.', '2006-08-05 09:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697026, 372413, 62174, '<td valign="top">Always supply the largest possible sample.  Too small.</td>', 'Always supply the largest possible sample.  Too small.', '2006-08-05 09:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697031, 372865, 34836, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe I''m going to say this, but there''s too much in focus.  The subject is obviously the two in front fighting for the ball.  It would have helped if you could have adjusted your depth of field to blur out the background.</td>', 'Can''t believe I''m going to say this, but there''s too much in focus.  The subject is obviously the two in front fighting for the ball.  It would have helped if you could have adjusted your depth of field to blur out the background.', '2006-08-05 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697034, 370135, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Good exposure and detail in the bird.  I couldn''t score this one high because I really like photos that fit the theme.  I just don''t see much action in the photo.  Still a great shot though.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Good exposure and detail in the bird.  I couldn''t score this one high because I really like photos that fit the theme.  I just don''t see much action in the photo.  Still a great shot though.', '2006-08-05 09:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697037, 373549, 62174, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where he''s jumping from or to, but the illusion of him jumping out into space is great.</td>', 'I don''t know where he''s jumping from or to, but the illusion of him jumping out into space is great.', '2006-08-05 09:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697040, 372102, 34836, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, and good composition.  I could not score this one too high because it just didn''t meet my expectations of Action.  Still a great photo though.  This photo would make for a great poster or advertisement.</td>', 'Excellent exposure, and good composition.  I could not score this one too high because it just didn''t meet my expectations of Action.  Still a great photo though.  This photo would make for a great poster or advertisement.', '2006-08-05 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
