(2697045, 370565, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and nice sharp focus on the head.  The composition needs just a little bit of work.  The chopping of the wings and the background factory take away from this photo.</td>', 'Good exposure and nice sharp focus on the head.  The composition needs just a little bit of work.  The chopping of the wings and the background factory take away from this photo.', '2006-08-05 10:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
