(2697835, 373305, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good capture, despite the smaller dimensions. I would suggest targeting the lightest area in the shot so that you don''t over expose and get blown highlights. This would also decrease shutter speed allowing a crisper freeze-frame.<br/> <br/>Lovely subject - beautiful creatures indeed.</td>', 'Good capture, despite the smaller dimensions. I would suggest targeting the lightest area in the shot so that you don''t over expose and get blown highlights. This would also decrease shutter speed allowing a crisper freeze-frame. Lovely subject - beautiful creatures indeed.', '2006-08-05 20:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
