(2699093, 373705, 28029, '<td valign="top">Cutting the head off does not work well here. A tighter crop would help also because the rest of the photo does not hold much interest. I do the same thing- that is get excited about my main image and forget that the photo is comprised of foreground, background etc. All elements have to work together to support the main interest. Often hard to do, but tighter crops help alot. Good luck. 6</td>', 'Cutting the head off does not work well here. A tighter crop would help also because the rest of the photo does not hold much interest. I do the same thing- that is get excited about my main image and forget that the photo is comprised of foreground, background etc. All elements have to work together to support the main interest. Often hard to do, but tighter crops help alot. Good luck. 6', '2006-08-06 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699096, 371703, 28029, '<td valign="top">I am happy to see more girl''s in action sports. Love the faces. The photo needs some clarity and (or) sharpness. 6</td>', 'I am happy to see more girl''s in action sports. Love the faces. The photo needs some clarity and (or) sharpness. 6', '2006-08-06 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
