(2700344, 373170, 44453, '<td valign="top">way too small, make sure that you use submit photos that are 640pixels on the longest side, not 250.  you cant expect a good score unless the voters can actually see some of the detail in the photo.</td>', 'way too small, make sure that you use submit photos that are 640pixels on the longest side, not 250.  you cant expect a good score unless the voters can actually see some of the detail in the photo.', '2006-08-06 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
