(2700356, 372413, 44453, '<td valign="top">might have been a better photo if you had submitted a bigger photo.  it''s very hard to vote high on such a small photo.  <br/>The colours are also very harsh and the composition is not very interesting</td>', 'might have been a better photo if you had submitted a bigger photo.  it''s very hard to vote high on such a small photo.  The colours are also very harsh and the composition is not very interesting', '2006-08-06 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700361, 373288, 44453, '<td valign="top">why have you stretched the photo horizontally? - it looks terrible like this.</td>', 'why have you stretched the photo horizontally? - it looks terrible like this.', '2006-08-06 22:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700370, 373289, 44453, '<td valign="top">this photo is way too small to give a high vote.  you need to make sure that your photo is 640 pixels on the longest (not 275) side so that voters can see as much detail as possible.</td>', 'this photo is way too small to give a high vote.  you need to make sure that your photo is 640 pixels on the longest (not 275) side so that voters can see as much detail as possible.', '2006-08-06 22:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700381, 370135, 58569, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is great!</td>', 'Wow! This is great!', '2006-08-06 22:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700393, 372486, 60698, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo! What a capture! It says so much!</td>', 'Fantastic photo! What a capture! It says so much!', '2006-08-06 22:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700394, 373533, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2006-08-06 22:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700395, 372179, 44453, '<td valign="top">not a bad action shot, I like the frozen splash and the facial expression but your processing seems to have given a very plastic feel to the finished photo, prehaps your jpeg compression was a bit too strong?  Also the photo is too small - if you had used the full 640 pixel allowance then the loss of detail from the jpeg compression would be less of a problem.</td>', 'not a bad action shot, I like the frozen splash and the facial expression but your processing seems to have given a very plastic feel to the finished photo, prehaps your jpeg compression was a bit too strong?  Also the photo is too small - if you had used the full 640 pixel allowance then the loss of detail from the jpeg compression would be less of a problem.', '2006-08-06 22:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700396, 370075, 44453, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of blured hands flying over the keys but you''ve overexposed this a bit too much in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the idea of blured hands flying over the keys but you''ve overexposed this a bit too much in my opinion.', '2006-08-06 22:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700400, 372704, 44453, '<td valign="top">nothing in this shot appears to be in focus.  a faster shutter speed would have helped freeze the action. and the composition of the photo would be a lot better with less background and more attention on the action.</td>', 'nothing in this shot appears to be in focus.  a faster shutter speed would have helped freeze the action. and the composition of the photo would be a lot better with less background and more attention on the action.', '2006-08-06 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700405, 370299, 44453, '<td valign="top">When using a slow shutter speed to emphasise movement in the photo you have to make sure that you keep the camera very still otherwise the background will also be blurred as has happened here.</td>', 'When using a slow shutter speed to emphasise movement in the photo you have to make sure that you keep the camera very still otherwise the background will also be blurred as has happened here.', '2006-08-06 22:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700416, 373675, 63267, '<td valign="top">I think a little crop off the top would really help this image.  My eyes are drawn to the light patches where the reeds are not as hight.  Great shot though, beautiful exposure.</td>', 'I think a little crop off the top would really help this image.  My eyes are drawn to the light patches where the reeds are not as hight.  Great shot though, beautiful exposure.', '2006-08-06 22:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
