(2700508, 372492, 44304, '<td valign="top">This was creative, and an original idea.  Good choice of food to be salted.  The red creates interest.</td>', 'This was creative, and an original idea.  Good choice of food to be salted.  The red creates interest.', '2006-08-06 23:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700512, 371990, 44304, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but maybe I''m just a sucker for dogs.  Composition is good.  My only gripe is the dog is slightly out of focus.</td>', 'I love this shot, but maybe I''m just a sucker for dogs.  Composition is good.  My only gripe is the dog is slightly out of focus.', '2006-08-06 23:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700518, 373761, 44304, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  You''ve stopped the motion well, but there seems to be a good bit of noise in the shot.  For some reason, it fits.  This looks a lot like a Nike ad.</td>', 'I like this one.  You''ve stopped the motion well, but there seems to be a good bit of noise in the shot.  For some reason, it fits.  This looks a lot like a Nike ad.', '2006-08-06 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700537, 373420, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the action in this phot, and the composition is great.  What I don''t like is that the focus seems to have locked on the front binding and not on the face.  The binding is much crsiper than the face, and I think the picture would have been better the other way around.  Great effort!</td>', 'I like the action in this phot, and the composition is great.  What I don''t like is that the focus seems to have locked on the front binding and not on the face.  The binding is much crsiper than the face, and I think the picture would have been better the other way around.  Great effort!', '2006-08-06 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700558, 371789, 63267, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know anybody still played tennis.  Great shot, but I think the clock on the right should have been cropped out.  I find myself being drawn to that trying to figure out the time as opposed to focusing on the player.</td>', 'I didn''t know anybody still played tennis.  Great shot, but I think the clock on the right should have been cropped out.  I find myself being drawn to that trying to figure out the time as opposed to focusing on the player.', '2006-08-06 23:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700569, 370910, 24846, '<td valign="top">I feel them moving to me. Good action, composition, colors. Typo/ Good luck -7-</td>', 'I feel them moving to me. Good action, composition, colors. Typo/ Good luck -7-', '2006-08-06 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700576, 373549, 24846, '<td valign="top">Obvious capture of a life force dropping out of a time worm. Neat shot, good luck.</td>', 'Obvious capture of a life force dropping out of a time worm. Neat shot, good luck.', '2006-08-06 23:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700578, 373494, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great composition here.</td>', 'Great composition here.', '2006-08-06 23:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700580, 373536, 24846, '<td valign="top">A hummer is always a neat capture but the background here is superb. -9-</td>', 'A hummer is always a neat capture but the background here is superb. -9-', '2006-08-06 23:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700586, 373420, 50289, '<td valign="top">Can''t find a flaw here.  Sharp image, good color, great depth of field, no motion blur.  Wow!  (10)</td>', 'Can''t find a flaw here.  Sharp image, good color, great depth of field, no motion blur.  Wow!  (10)', '2006-08-06 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700593, 371627, 63267, '<td valign="top">To me these carnival pictures with the lights never get old.  Only thing I thnk that could make it better would be a more dramatic sky, or even twilight as opposed to black.  Overall a great image!</td>', 'To me these carnival pictures with the lights never get old.  Only thing I thnk that could make it better would be a more dramatic sky, or even twilight as opposed to black.  Overall a great image!', '2006-08-06 23:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700595, 373097, 50289, '<td valign="top">Boy, this is going to be a close challenge I think.  Some great shots and yours should be in the top 10 if not the top 5.  Great sharpness, no motion blur.  Really good job!</td>', 'Boy, this is going to be a close challenge I think.  Some great shots and yours should be in the top 10 if not the top 5.  Great sharpness, no motion blur.  Really good job!', '2006-08-06 23:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700597, 372790, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is really a neat photo.</td>', 'This is really a neat photo.', '2006-08-06 23:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700604, 373732, 24846, '<td valign="top">This is an image where sharp focus is not necessary, would actually be a distraction in a sense. Great colors and the "tusk" like effect on the show horse is cool. Probably will be under rated but an enthusiastic 9 from me. Good luck.</td>', 'This is an image where sharp focus is not necessary, would actually be a distraction in a sense. Great colors and the "tusk" like effect on the show horse is cool. Probably will be under rated but an enthusiastic 9 from me. Good luck.', '2006-08-06 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700611, 373017, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, but would have been a little better in my opinion if the subject wasn''t so dark.</td>', 'Great action shot, but would have been a little better in my opinion if the subject wasn''t so dark.', '2006-08-06 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700613, 370977, 50289, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the determined expresions on the faces.  Perfect DOF.  Good sharpness and color.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the determined expresions on the faces.  Perfect DOF.  Good sharpness and color.', '2006-08-06 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1);
