(2700631, 373296, 50289, '<td valign="top">IMO, the main flaw in this shot would be the cropping.  It would have been much better to have either cropped back a little so you didn''t cut off the top of the heads and included all of the wheels or cropped tighter so you had all of the heads and cut it off at the shins.  Otherwise, not too bad.</td>', 'IMO, the main flaw in this shot would be the cropping.  It would have been much better to have either cropped back a little so you didn''t cut off the top of the heads and included all of the wheels or cropped tighter so you had all of the heads and cut it off at the shins.  Otherwise, not too bad.', '2006-08-06 23:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700640, 372686, 63267, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!  Look at the determination and intensity in those eyes.  Not to mention the ears flopping in the wind.  Great exposure to keep the details in the white dogs from being blown out while salvaging the details in the darker ones as well.<br/> <br/>This is really awesome!</td>', 'Excellent photo!  Look at the determination and intensity in those eyes.  Not to mention the ears flopping in the wind.  Great exposure to keep the details in the white dogs from being blown out while salvaging the details in the darker ones as well. This is really awesome!', '2006-08-06 23:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
