(2703145, 373742, 63269, '<td valign="top">A very startling picture!</td>', 'A very startling picture!', '2006-08-07 14:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703148, 373693, 63269, '<td valign="top">WOw! What ''splooshed?'' The photograph almost seems a bit crooked, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'WOw! What ''splooshed?'' The photograph almost seems a bit crooked, but I like it a lot.', '2006-08-07 15:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703151, 373688, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a very striking image, perhaps if the bird was more focused...</td>', 'I think this would be a very striking image, perhaps if the bird was more focused...', '2006-08-07 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703154, 372060, 63269, '<td valign="top">I would like to try that! Neat shot.</td>', 'I would like to try that! Neat shot.', '2006-08-07 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703160, 370798, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the way everything has an almost repeated, patterned feel... like the helmets are all lined up in a row. Awesome!</td>', 'I love the way everything has an almost repeated, patterned feel... like the helmets are all lined up in a row. Awesome!', '2006-08-07 15:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703166, 373626, 63269, '<td valign="top">Ahh, wonderful close-up and nice expression. My cat doesn''t like the camera so close to her face...:) HOwever I don''t really feel that this fits all that well with the action theme.</td>', 'Ahh, wonderful close-up and nice expression. My cat doesn''t like the camera so close to her face...:) HOwever I don''t really feel that this fits all that well with the action theme.', '2006-08-07 15:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703173, 371531, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wow! I like it a lot, even thought I''m entirely sure what it is.</td>', 'Wow! I like it a lot, even thought I''m entirely sure what it is.', '2006-08-07 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703177, 372094, 63269, '<td valign="top">Amazing! the composition might be a little helter-skelter, but it''s still a very neat image.</td>', 'Amazing! the composition might be a little helter-skelter, but it''s still a very neat image.', '2006-08-07 15:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703179, 370665, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good!</td>', 'Good!', '2006-08-07 15:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703186, 373645, 63269, '<td valign="top">How did you manage to get the biker so clear, and the background so smooth blurred?! Incredible - and the crooked horizon adds so much intrest to the picture.</td>', 'How did you manage to get the biker so clear, and the background so smooth blurred?! Incredible - and the crooked horizon adds so much intrest to the picture.', '2006-08-07 15:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703194, 372320, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp picture.</td>', 'Nice crisp picture.', '2006-08-07 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703203, 373735, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fabulously intresting - it has such a classic feel to it with that black and white. I''m not sure why it''s an action shot though... I really love it thought!</td>', 'Fabulously intresting - it has such a classic feel to it with that black and white. I''m not sure why it''s an action shot though... I really love it thought!', '2006-08-07 15:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703204, 370316, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very good.</td>', 'Wow! Very good.', '2006-08-07 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703211, 373531, 35348, '<td valign="top">WOW! Not only a great photograph...nice focus, great DOF, and I love the B/W...but an absolutly insane stunt! - 9</td>', 'WOW! Not only a great photograph...nice focus, great DOF, and I love the B/W...but an absolutly insane stunt! - 9', '2006-08-07 15:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703215, 373190, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! It''s intresting, but perhaps a diffrent angle would have worked better than a head-on. Maybe it would add more dimention to the photo.</td>', 'Oh wow! It''s intresting, but perhaps a diffrent angle would have worked better than a head-on. Maybe it would add more dimention to the photo.', '2006-08-07 15:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703218, 372911, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely. :)</td>', 'Lovely. :)', '2006-08-07 15:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703224, 373717, 63269, '<td valign="top">A fabulous shot - the car is distracting, but the picture is certainly full of action.</td>', 'A fabulous shot - the car is distracting, but the picture is certainly full of action.', '2006-08-07 15:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703229, 373536, 63269, '<td valign="top">At last there''s no bird feeder at the edge of the picture! I like this humming bird a lot. It''s very clear and well-focused.</td>', 'At last there''s no bird feeder at the edge of the picture! I like this humming bird a lot. It''s very clear and well-focused.', '2006-08-07 15:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703238, 373718, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2006-08-07 15:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703247, 371009, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is really intresting... for some reason it struck me more than some of the other aircraft pictures I''ve seen.</td>', 'This is really intresting... for some reason it struck me more than some of the other aircraft pictures I''ve seen.', '2006-08-07 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703254, 372739, 63269, '<td valign="top">Great action, althought the picture has an almost milk look to it - do you know what I mean?</td>', 'Great action, althought the picture has an almost milk look to it - do you know what I mean?', '2006-08-07 15:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703256, 373549, 35348, '<td valign="top">seems like more then basic editing to me</td>', 'seems like more then basic editing to me', '2006-08-07 15:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703258, 370921, 63269, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love it!</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love it!', '2006-08-07 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703263, 372662, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully clear, good shot.</td>', 'Wonderfully clear, good shot.', '2006-08-07 15:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703268, 373590, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like this one, it''s quite intresting.</td>', 'I like this one, it''s quite intresting.', '2006-08-07 15:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703269, 371605, 35348, '<td valign="top">great colors, and very good focus on the moving car</td>', 'great colors, and very good focus on the moving car', '2006-08-07 15:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703271, 371865, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very good, but the powerlines in the background are very distracting.</td>', 'Very good, but the powerlines in the background are very distracting.', '2006-08-07 15:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703279, 371585, 35348, '<td valign="top">I like it...great colors</td>', 'I like it...great colors', '2006-08-07 15:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703284, 373333, 35348, '<td valign="top">fantastic colors...and amazing focus on a really fast moving subject!</td>', 'fantastic colors...and amazing focus on a really fast moving subject!', '2006-08-07 15:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703330, 371896, 42869, '<td valign="top">Too stark for my tastes.  When I see something like this I think more of a glide than "action."  I know the title says high speed, but this doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Too stark for my tastes.  When I see something like this I think more of a glide than "action."  I know the title says high speed, but this doesn''t do it for me.', '2006-08-07 15:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703336, 372790, 42869, '<td valign="top">I like the picture overall but I don''t see "action" - no surf spray, no movement - it''s quite peaceful.  The reflection is good, the color is good - I''d like to see the image size a little larger, but not bad.</td>', 'I like the picture overall but I don''t see "action" - no surf spray, no movement - it''s quite peaceful.  The reflection is good, the color is good - I''d like to see the image size a little larger, but not bad.', '2006-08-07 15:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703380, 372688, 42869, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of action.  I like the freeze of everything (including people) except for the motorcycle.</td>', 'Nice capture of action.  I like the freeze of everything (including people) except for the motorcycle.', '2006-08-07 15:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703383, 372865, 42869, '<td valign="top">This might have done better in the "motion freeze" catagory.  There is implied action but no movement, no blur, nothing that says "fast"</td>', 'This might have done better in the "motion freeze" catagory.  There is implied action but no movement, no blur, nothing that says "fast"', '2006-08-07 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703389, 370497, 42869, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but I''m not sure how this applies to "action shot".  Nice placement, cute model, nice use of graineness (is that a word?).</td>', 'I like the picture but I''m not sure how this applies to "action shot".  Nice placement, cute model, nice use of graineness (is that a word?).', '2006-08-07 15:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703414, 373530, 42869, '<td valign="top">So I''ve seen a few pictures like this now - things are are action but they''d be a better fit for "stopped motion" challenge.  The action here is well frozen and the blur in the background looks like DOF and not motion panning.  I would have liked this picture a lot better if the spokes were blurred, the crowd was blurred from panning, and it wasn''t so "frozen"</td>', 'So I''ve seen a few pictures like this now - things are are action but they''d be a better fit for "stopped motion" challenge.  The action here is well frozen and the blur in the background looks like DOF and not motion panning.  I would have liked this picture a lot better if the spokes were blurred, the crowd was blurred from panning, and it wasn''t so "frozen"', '2006-08-07 15:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703417, 373698, 42869, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge.  Good that it shows the vibration but a little over saturated.</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge.  Good that it shows the vibration but a little over saturated.', '2006-08-07 15:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703422, 373232, 42869, '<td valign="top">Good concept but too small</td>', 'Good concept but too small', '2006-08-07 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703428, 372867, 42869, '<td valign="top">So here is the one thing about action shots - something has to be in focus somewhere.  Whether its the subject in focus and the background is blurred from motion panning or the background is sharp but the subject is motion blurred - just something.  Yes, there is action here, but it''s just all blurry.</td>', 'So here is the one thing about action shots - something has to be in focus somewhere.  Whether its the subject in focus and the background is blurred from motion panning or the background is sharp but the subject is motion blurred - just something.  Yes, there is action here, but it''s just all blurry.', '2006-08-07 16:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703439, 372723, 42869, '<td valign="top">The title gets a chuckle.  A little too "frozen action" for my taste - would have liked a little more action blur but not a bad shot.</td>', 'The title gets a chuckle.  A little too "frozen action" for my taste - would have liked a little more action blur but not a bad shot.', '2006-08-07 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703446, 373463, 57384, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good idea, but the shot would probably be better with a bit of motion blur. If you could keep the bike focused and give the impression of moving really fast with the rest of the photo it''d be great. I like the arm in the rear view mirror.</td>', 'I think this is a good idea, but the shot would probably be better with a bit of motion blur. If you could keep the bike focused and give the impression of moving really fast with the rest of the photo it''d be great. I like the arm in the rear view mirror.', '2006-08-07 16:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703448, 371433, 42869, '<td valign="top">Well composed photo - too "stopped motion" for my taste, not much action.</td>', 'Well composed photo - too "stopped motion" for my taste, not much action.', '2006-08-07 16:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703450, 372816, 42869, '<td valign="top">Good picture but the subject isn''t in motion - he''s frozen.  No racquet blur, no ball, just stopped motion.</td>', 'Good picture but the subject isn''t in motion - he''s frozen.  No racquet blur, no ball, just stopped motion.', '2006-08-07 16:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703453, 372218, 42869, '<td valign="top">Now we''re getting somewhere.  I''ve just rated about 10% of the photos and a lot of my comments have been "uh, this is frozen motion..."  This is good motion blur - fence moving by quickly, horses legs in action - I would have liked a little less harsh light to the horses weren''t in so much shadow but not much you can do about that.  Good capture.</td>', 'Now we''re getting somewhere.  I''ve just rated about 10% of the photos and a lot of my comments have been "uh, this is frozen motion..."  This is good motion blur - fence moving by quickly, horses legs in action - I would have liked a little less harsh light to the horses weren''t in so much shadow but not much you can do about that.  Good capture.', '2006-08-07 16:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703458, 373165, 42869, '<td valign="top">Bravo - these can be hard to grab.  I''ve shot a lot of IndyCar racing and recently some American Le Mans series.  Nice capture with the full car in focus during motion panning.</td>', 'Bravo - these can be hard to grab.  I''ve shot a lot of IndyCar racing and recently some American Le Mans series.  Nice capture with the full car in focus during motion panning.', '2006-08-07 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703466, 372492, 42869, '<td valign="top">Should be "salt frozen in motion" - with the opposing challenge being "stopped motion," this would have been a better entry over there.  No motion blur here at all.</td>', 'Should be "salt frozen in motion" - with the opposing challenge being "stopped motion," this would have been a better entry over there.  No motion blur here at all.', '2006-08-07 16:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703487, 372997, 42869, '<td valign="top">Whoa - couple things here.  First, no real motion - it''s a pretty static picture, frozen in place.  Second, what''s up with the halos around the person and parasail?  Either it''s been dodged to lighten it up or the unsharp mask way overused.  Now I see that it''s been validated, so it''s not dodging - not sure where the halo is coming from...</td>', 'Whoa - couple things here.  First, no real motion - it''s a pretty static picture, frozen in place.  Second, what''s up with the halos around the person and parasail?  Either it''s been dodged to lighten it up or the unsharp mask way overused.  Now I see that it''s been validated, so it''s not dodging - not sure where the halo is coming from...', '2006-08-07 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703493, 373268, 42869, '<td valign="top">Yes yes yes - so many images have been frozen motion but here is one that''s got more elements than that - motion blur of the dirt, frozen action of the ball and fantastic expressions on all faces.  This is a great image and it just makes me smile - nicely done!</td>', 'Yes yes yes - so many images have been frozen motion but here is one that''s got more elements than that - motion blur of the dirt, frozen action of the ball and fantastic expressions on all faces.  This is a great image and it just makes me smile - nicely done!', '2006-08-07 16:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703498, 371009, 42869, '<td valign="top">Seattle Seafair?  A little too dark/shadowy for me.</td>', 'Seattle Seafair?  A little too dark/shadowy for me.', '2006-08-07 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703503, 373626, 42869, '<td valign="top">Good picture but not really an "action shot"</td>', 'Good picture but not really an "action shot"', '2006-08-07 16:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
