(2703574, 370706, 42869, '<td valign="top">I''m just not seeing action here...  It''s all frozen motion, no motion blur, nothing moving, just frozen.</td>', 'I''m just not seeing action here...  It''s all frozen motion, no motion blur, nothing moving, just frozen.', '2006-08-07 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
