(2703985, 373293, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your subject is there and prominent but it lacks punch, interest and compositional strength. Offsetting the rider and either getting closer (to see more of the rider''s face and stress) or including the whole bike may have improved it.</td>', 'Your subject is there and prominent but it lacks punch, interest and compositional strength. Offsetting the rider and either getting closer (to see more of the rider''s face and stress) or including the whole bike may have improved it.', '2006-08-07 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703993, 371302, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now you know as well as I do that the voters won''t put this at the top - unless he''s surfing or riding a motocross bike - but I share your admiration of these heroic little creatures. Brilliant take on the challenge.<br/> <br/>A longer DOF would help to see more of what he''s carrying, but it''s pretty well composed.</td>', 'Now you know as well as I do that the voters won''t put this at the top - unless he''s surfing or riding a motocross bike - but I share your admiration of these heroic little creatures. Brilliant take on the challenge. A longer DOF would help to see more of what he''s carrying, but it''s pretty well composed.', '2006-08-07 19:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
