(2704000, 372719, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shame you felt the need to ruin your title by stating the obvious - but I love the idea here and the shot is lovely too. I often wonder how amazing our world would seem if people could see trees and plant life growing at the same pace as we move around. I think they''d have more respect for nature.</td>', 'Shame you felt the need to ruin your title by stating the obvious - but I love the idea here and the shot is lovely too. I often wonder how amazing our world would seem if people could see trees and plant life growing at the same pace as we move around. I think they''d have more respect for nature.', '2006-08-07 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704006, 373654, 44453, '<td valign="top">great detail on the bee!!  it doesnt seem to work as a photo though, the composition is quite strange - the top half of the photo takes away from a really good bottom half.  And the vertical orientation makes me want to turn my head sideways.  Still you get a good score just for how hard bees are to photograph.</td>', 'great detail on the bee!!  it doesnt seem to work as a photo though, the composition is quite strange - the top half of the photo takes away from a really good bottom half.  And the vertical orientation makes me want to turn my head sideways.  Still you get a good score just for how hard bees are to photograph.', '2006-08-07 19:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
