(2706992, 373026, 8860, '<td valign="top">If you have this dancer''s e-mail address you could recommend Sure for Men which is fairly strong - even during the toughest routines - although the roll-on is quite ineffectual, especially if applied after a shower and the armpit is not fully dried.<br/> <br/>The photo on the other hand is odourless, but has a fairly tight crop at the top, so a bit more space would be good. It does lack a bit of atmosphere or context which could have been assisted by some crowd or judges in the background. Otherwise a sound capture.</td>', 'If you have this dancer''s e-mail address you could recommend Sure for Men which is fairly strong - even during the toughest routines - although the roll-on is quite ineffectual, especially if applied after a shower and the armpit is not fully dried. The photo on the other hand is odourless, but has a fairly tight crop at the top, so a bit more space would be good. It does lack a bit of atmosphere or context which could have been assisted by some crowd or judges in the background. Otherwise a sound capture.', '2006-08-08 17:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706996, 373730, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint and action but the composition is tasd loose. I think that filling the frame with him would have been best, since there is no useful background forming any function in the shot. I also feel that I''d like to have seen his feet - in my mind he should be on a grassy hill, all alone.</td>', 'Good viewpoint and action but the composition is tasd loose. I think that filling the frame with him would have been best, since there is no useful background forming any function in the shot. I also feel that I''d like to have seen his feet - in my mind he should be on a grassy hill, all alone.', '2006-08-08 17:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707002, 372790, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great view - I like this take on the challenge.</td>', 'Great view - I like this take on the challenge.', '2006-08-08 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
