(2707608, 372790, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Aside from your title and perhaps the wave/water movement, there is little ''action'' <i>captured</i> here in my opinion (and my interpretation of the Challenge).  However, very nice shot - if the horizon were straight, a more refined crop (although the ropes(?) do give more context so who knows) and bigger (640 width in this case) make this much better.  Looks almost like glass.</td>', '4 - Aside from your title and perhaps the wave/water movement, there is little ''action'' captured here in my opinion (and my interpretation of the Challenge).  However, very nice shot - if the horizon were straight, a more refined crop (although the ropes(?) do give more context so who knows) and bigger (640 width in this case) make this much better.  Looks almost like glass.', '2006-08-08 21:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707614, 373327, 56744, '<td valign="top">Oh!... a b&amp;w version. Good shot too</td>', 'Oh!... a b&w version. Good shot too', '2006-08-08 21:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
