(2707627, 373330, 41200, '<td valign="top">Great shot...sure to be top 10.</td>', 'Great shot...sure to be top 10.', '2006-08-08 21:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707631, 373504, 41200, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. Great decision to exclude any geography from the frame.</td>', 'Nice silhouette. Great decision to exclude any geography from the frame.', '2006-08-08 21:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707636, 372748, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good capture and angle.  I see the crop dilemma.  Difficult with the opportunity capture but sharper and more definition/contrast (also difficult with the light/dark ranges) make this even better in my opinion.  Possibly also a nudge rotate up on the right to ''straighten'' - might have meant sacrificing one of the nesting gulls and going for a square crop.  Might have also reduced the ''crop dilemma''.  Depends what you had to work with, obviously.</td>', '6 - Good capture and angle.  I see the crop dilemma.  Difficult with the opportunity capture but sharper and more definition/contrast (also difficult with the light/dark ranges) make this even better in my opinion.  Possibly also a nudge rotate up on the right to ''straighten'' - might have meant sacrificing one of the nesting gulls and going for a square crop.  Might have also reduced the ''crop dilemma''.  Depends what you had to work with, obviously.', '2006-08-08 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707638, 373097, 41200, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DoF and the tight crop. One of the best in the challenge imo.</td>', 'I like the shallow DoF and the tight crop. One of the best in the challenge imo.', '2006-08-08 21:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707643, 370271, 63568, '<td valign="top">Good timing on the horses canter</td>', 'Good timing on the horses canter', '2006-08-08 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707664, 373003, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Not sure what, but needs ''tweaking'' - whether it be a variation in composition, colors or even toning/b&amp;w conversion, crop, not sure.  Just think there is more potential ''somehow'' with such a unique capture, in my opinion.  I realize however the restrictions with basic editing.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Not sure what, but needs ''tweaking'' - whether it be a variation in composition, colors or even toning/b&w conversion, crop, not sure.  Just think there is more potential ''somehow'' with such a unique capture, in my opinion.  I realize however the restrictions with basic editing.', '2006-08-08 21:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707677, 372241, 40546, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t the trick have been to catch the hummingbirds wings in motion as opposed to stopping the motion??</td>', 'Wouldn''t the trick have been to catch the hummingbirds wings in motion as opposed to stopping the motion??', '2006-08-08 21:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707682, 373148, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice definition - sure this size doesn''t do this justice.  The rock face/background dof works well.  Perhaps a slight variation in composition or cropping may have made this even better, not sure.</td>', '8 - Nice definition - sure this size doesn''t do this justice.  The rock face/background dof works well.  Perhaps a slight variation in composition or cropping may have made this even better, not sure.', '2006-08-08 21:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707693, 373062, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good, muddy, capture.  Difficult, but just a <i>fraction</i> more vivid coloring(s) and this at 640 width, be even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Good, muddy, capture.  Difficult, but just a fraction more vivid coloring(s) and this at 640 width, be even better in my opinion.', '2006-08-08 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707700, 373697, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Difficult, but just a little sharper/more definition/clarity, the colors perhaps tweaked <i>slightly</i> and a more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a more vertical framing/crop may have given this an edge, especially using the ''lines'' where the board is cutting into the water, who knows.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Difficult, but just a little sharper/more definition/clarity, the colors perhaps tweaked slightly and a more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a more vertical framing/crop may have given this an edge, especially using the ''lines'' where the board is cutting into the water, who knows.', '2006-08-08 22:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707708, 373420, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture and clarity.  Minor, but not sure on the frame, especially the color.</td>', '8 - Good capture and clarity.  Minor, but not sure on the frame, especially the color.', '2006-08-08 22:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
