(2707722, 372901, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Difficult, but looks like it needs a fraction nudge up on the left - but could be ''perspective'' or natural.  Upper left corner more finely cropped too.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Difficult, but looks like it needs a fraction nudge up on the left - but could be ''perspective'' or natural.  Upper left corner more finely cropped too.', '2006-08-08 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
