(2710139, 370162, 25678, '<td valign="top">Nice one!!</td>', 'Nice one!!', '2006-08-09 10:22:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2710148, 370889, 23430, '<td valign="top">Hey Enzo, I like this one. It''s a good composition. I like how there''s a line leading up to your main subject. It''s a great shot but you were up against some other great shots too. Probably helps to know the game to fully appreciate it. I like the crowd in the background too but I also wonder how it would have been if you went the short DOF and had them out of focus.</td>', 'Hey Enzo, I like this one. It''s a good composition. I like how there''s a line leading up to your main subject. It''s a great shot but you were up against some other great shots too. Probably helps to know the game to fully appreciate it. I like the crowd in the background too but I also wonder how it would have been if you went the short DOF and had them out of focus.', '2006-08-09 10:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2710219, 372686, 51538, '<td valign="top">IMO, this image is much richer in story and detail than either the blue or red ribbon winners.  Congratulations on your top three place.</td>', 'IMO, this image is much richer in story and detail than either the blue or red ribbon winners.  Congratulations on your top three place.', '2006-08-09 10:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
