(2711316, 372759, 22114, '<td valign="top">Uhm, lets all just forget about this one, deal? Note to self: Never submit a holiday photo when no one else gets it and don''t share the memory of it.<br/> <br/>Sigh. I think I either need to stop submitting photos, or start taking this more seriously.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all of you that bothered to vote, and especially those who commented.</td>', 'Uhm, lets all just forget about this one, deal? Note to self: Never submit a holiday photo when no one else gets it and don''t share the memory of it. Sigh. I think I either need to stop submitting photos, or start taking this more seriously. Thanks to all of you that bothered to vote, and especially those who commented.', '2006-08-09 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2711542, 372686, 10686, '<td valign="top">A great shot of a cruel sport.</td>', 'A great shot of a cruel sport.', '2006-08-09 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2711568, 372701, 62318, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite photo of the bunch. Good dynamic capture.</td>', 'This was my favorite photo of the bunch. Good dynamic capture.', '2006-08-09 17:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2711583, 373571, 51793, '<td valign="top">Sorry you didn''t get what you were looking for out of this picture but it is a really great picture.</td>', 'Sorry you didn''t get what you were looking for out of this picture but it is a really great picture.', '2006-08-09 17:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2711617, 372218, 11923, '<td valign="top">Had I voted I probably would''ve given this a 6.  I think there''s some great motion here, and that bodes well for an "action" challenge.  There are a few hot spots that distract the eye, the blue jockey''s hat and a bit of the rail on the inside section of the track.  I also tried ''cropping'' the image myself by adjusting the screen size and I liked it better with that blurry reddish/pink area on the right cropped out.  I found it made the image feel a bit more open and almost as if they could be close to the finish line - for some reason the addition of the reddish area made it feel closed up and less dramatic to me.  I''m just weird that way I guess.  Sharp focus can almost always be better but I think you did a good job here, especially when panning.</td>', 'Had I voted I probably would''ve given this a 6.  I think there''s some great motion here, and that bodes well for an "action" challenge.  There are a few hot spots that distract the eye, the blue jockey''s hat and a bit of the rail on the inside section of the track.  I also tried ''cropping'' the image myself by adjusting the screen size and I liked it better with that blurry reddish/pink area on the right cropped out.  I found it made the image feel a bit more open and almost as if they could be close to the finish line - for some reason the addition of the reddish area made it feel closed up and less dramatic to me.  I''m just weird that way I guess.  Sharp focus can almost always be better but I think you did a good job here, especially when panning.', '2006-08-09 17:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2711623, 370179, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Doc! We do get quite the storms during the monsoon and no rain is not unusual (But I am sure you know that). I got 15 or 20 good shots of lightning just 2 days before yours I have a few in my portfolio. I guess your timing was better due to the fact you got into a challenge with one. :-P <br/> <br/>Good stuff and a top 20, very nice!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-09 18:43:59.</i></td>', 'Nice shot Doc! We do get quite the storms during the monsoon and no rain is not unusual (But I am sure you know that). I got 15 or 20 good shots of lightning just 2 days before yours I have a few in my portfolio. I guess your timing was better due to the fact you got into a challenge with one. :-P  Good stuff and a top 20, very nice!', '2006-08-09 17:19:45.000000', '2006-08-09 19:43:59.000000', 0),
(2711676, 372952, 63756, '<td valign="top">Hey,<br/>This is Justin Kistler from your photography class at CBLI. It''s kool to see that you put a picture from CBLI here. Hope it does well!<br/> <br/>-Justin</td>', 'Hey,This is Justin Kistler from your photography class at CBLI. It''s kool to see that you put a picture from CBLI here. Hope it does well! -Justin', '2006-08-09 17:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2711900, 373504, 27482, '<td valign="top">Darn!  Looks like we are all even again in the ribbon race, time to put on the warpaint I guess and try to get ahead of you again :)  Congrats on the ribbon buddy!</td>', 'Darn!  Looks like we are all even again in the ribbon race, time to put on the warpaint I guess and try to get ahead of you again :)  Congrats on the ribbon buddy!', '2006-08-09 18:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
