(2716928, 373742, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very good intersection of diagonal lines. Good shutter speed trade-off (subject sharpness Vs. background motion blur).<br/>The skater also looks almost monk-like for the concentration and the posture. It tells a lot about skateboarding, at least, that is my impression.<br/>It''s not so common for action shots to convey a meaning beyond the mere action.<br/>Excellent shot then.<br/>On my top five for sure.</td>', 'Very good intersection of diagonal lines. Good shutter speed trade-off (subject sharpness Vs. background motion blur).The skater also looks almost monk-like for the concentration and the posture. It tells a lot about skateboarding, at least, that is my impression.It''s not so common for action shots to convey a meaning beyond the mere action.Excellent shot then.On my top five for sure.', '2006-08-11 07:46:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2716999, 373600, 49326, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome! Congrats on your 9th and your personal best. I love this shot and I think it''s underrated though it got a nice 6.8. Maybe the burnt out part of the sky lowers the score. That''s the only thing I don''t like about. Everything else is very good!</td>', 'Wow, awesome! Congrats on your 9th and your personal best. I love this shot and I think it''s underrated though it got a nice 6.8. Maybe the burnt out part of the sky lowers the score. That''s the only thing I don''t like about. Everything else is very good!', '2006-08-11 08:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
