(2790981, 373170, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hiya..<br/>Welcome to DPC.. .<br/>I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently..<br/> <br/>Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)<br/>Cheers<br/>----------------------------------------<br/> <br/>It''s a nice photo.. shoul be a really nice photo..<br/>Watch out as the coters usually vote down photos that does not make full use of the 640px... I''ve been bitten to know better.. <br/>Lovely all the same.. a pity it didn''t score higher.. keep up the good work.. :)</td>', 'Hiya..Welcome to DPC.. .I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently.. Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)Cheers---------------------------------------- It''s a nice photo.. shoul be a really nice photo..Watch out as the coters usually vote down photos that does not make full use of the 640px... I''ve been bitten to know better.. Lovely all the same.. a pity it didn''t score higher.. keep up the good work.. :)', '2006-09-03 04:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2797479, 370914, 37858, '<td valign="top">Great commentary...and photo.  I think the only thing the photo lacks is a little more action (pins spinning in all directions) but who knows how many injuries you would have suffered to get that shot!  Love the lighting.  If you ever get the idea to try this again, I wonder if a faster exposure setting would work well with the pins flying in all directions.</td>', 'Great commentary...and photo.  I think the only thing the photo lacks is a little more action (pins spinning in all directions) but who knows how many injuries you would have suffered to get that shot!  Love the lighting.  If you ever get the idea to try this again, I wonder if a faster exposure setting would work well with the pins flying in all directions.', '2006-09-04 18:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2798419, 372959, 48524, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture, amazing atmosphere; I love 30 Seconds to Mars and Jared Leto, got a bunch of great shots of him as well.  I totally wouldn''t have the guts to bring a camera that big to a concert where I''ll be that close, though; I nearly got crushed with my Powershot :)</td>', 'Awesome capture, amazing atmosphere; I love 30 Seconds to Mars and Jared Leto, got a bunch of great shots of him as well.  I totally wouldn''t have the guts to bring a camera that big to a concert where I''ll be that close, though; I nearly got crushed with my Powershot :)', '2006-09-04 23:00:52.000000', NULL, 0),
